  type_object_iface_err_body.pcpp - break step of type_object_iface.pcpp:
  an interface method with a body: the objects implement it (PR0060)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\type_object_iface_err_body.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\type_object_iface_err_body.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
